  source_scan: Two installer links remain policy-blocked and cause incomplete scanning.
  c31: Canonical-input publication refactor has local regression and Edge smoke evidence; remote capability admission remains blocked and no deployment occurred. See publication-canonical-input-review.json.
  c32: Native seed response/CORS identity corrected and tested in real Edge with synthetic bytes. Read-only MiniModel metadata supports HEAD/ranges/CORS but remains empty and authority-incomplete. See native-seed-browser-contract-review.json; model routes and safe publication remain unproven.
